  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Elevation in Boiling point&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />For non-electrolyte,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>m= Molar mass of solute</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>molality</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solution</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>molality</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solution</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
